      "rationale": "Warm up linearly over epochs 1–10, then decay the learning rate with a cosine schedule to 10% of the baseline rate at epoch 200. This may stabilize early optimization and late ranking performance while preserving Adam, batch size, dropout, weight decay, loss, and checkpoint selection.",
      "edits": [
        {
          "find": "NUM_EPOCHS   = int(os.environ.get(\"SASREC_EPOCHS\",    \"300\"))",
